  "requiredRules": [
    "Evidence Service owns evidence identity, metadata, immutable versions and content references.",
    "Document Intelligence output remains a source-traceable non-authoritative intermediate.",
    "Financial Profile Service alone promotes validated facts into provider-neutral authoritative financial state.",
    "Job Management Service owns execution mechanics and never business truth.",
    "Audit Service appends immutable governed evidence without becoming transactional authority.",
    "Protected receivers enforce authorization and applicable current consent server-side.",
    "Retries and event replay cannot create duplicate authoritative effects.",
    "Financial facts retain source evidence, observation, transformation version, security actor, time and correlation context.",
    "Reference adapters are restricted to LOCAL and CI_EPHEMERAL execution zones.",
    "Logs and telemetry exclude evidence bytes, extracted sensitive values, credentials, tokens and secrets."
  ]
